# Universal Commerce Protocol (UCP) Codeowners

# Default for all files.
*  @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/devops-maintainers

# Infrastructure & Tooling
/.github/                 @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/devops-maintainers

# Meeting Minutes - Domain Tech Councils (and the DWGs they sponsor).
# DWG minutes are nested under their sponsoring council (tc/<domain>/dwg/<name>/)
# so that DTC oversight of DWG artifacts applies by default.
#
# @devops-maintainers is listed alongside each council as a backup approver, so
# minutes are never blocked when a council is unavailable or not yet staffed.
# This keeps the approval path /tc/ already has today via the default owner.
/tc/food/      @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/food-tech-council @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/devops-maintainers
/tc/lodging/   @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/lodging-tech-council @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/devops-maintainers
/tc/payments/  @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/payments-tech-council @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/devops-maintainers
/tc/shopping/  @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/shopping-tech-council @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/devops-maintainers

# Meeting Minutes - Governing Council
/gc/                      @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/governance-council

# Governance
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @Universal-Commerce-Protocol/governance-council
